ova","role":"wounded","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rZRuYsURbO0X3i0TfpT9nflYGcV.jpg"},{"id":2216730,"name":"Vladimir Golitsyn","role":"fighter","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4iZdnllDejm7HJLghT9zb1VDzDK.jpg"},{"id":2216737,"name":"Vitaly Kondrashov","role":"fighter","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ckKPq91aSpoBHK2QonuZYPm2jzF.jpg"},{"id":2216745,"name":"Andrey Kolesnikov","role":"speaker","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a0LrgrTsX8FH6Tleeedgc9kRdW2.jpg"},{"id":2216755,"name":"Ivan Zarhin","role":"hourly","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wlDAMIGuOoR7jO2DUyL1SOEgThA.jpg"},{"id":2216758,"name":"Maxim Vinogradov","role":"Igor","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dnPwEpdKitacZ87uxCrptKeXXvB.jpg"},{"id":2456945,"name":"Sergey Propazhin","role":"driver mechanic","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mwdOTV6OuOjhNTBXbDXrC6HlCH6.jpg"},{"id":4252767,"name":"Sergey Ershov","role":"officer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kEpMxSNo85fyaHDiNO4ffSXzJ1D.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"The Blackout","overview":"Nessun meteorite ha colpito la Terra, nessun terrorista ha messo in pericolo il mondo, nessuna guerra atomica è stata avviata, ma qualcosa è andato storto. Il contatto tra la maggior parte delle città sulla Terra è stato interrotto. Una piccola area ad anello nell'Est Europa ha ancora elettricità, e forse anche la vita viene segnalata dallo spazio. Ciò che le forze militari trovano fuori dall'Anello è scioccante. Ci sono cadaveri ovunque: nei negozi, nelle automobili, sulle strade, negli ospedali e nelle stazioni ferroviarie. Chi o cosa sta distruggendo tutta la vita sulla Terra?","tagline":"Chi si salverà quando il mondo cadrà nell'oscurità?"},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Blackout","overview":"Contact between most towns on Earth has been severed. A small ring-like area in Eastern Europe still has electricity, and maybe even life is being reported from space. What military forces find outside the ring is shocking.","tagline":"Who's going to save you when the world falls into darkness?"},{"language":"ru-RU","title":"Аванпост","overview":"В недалёком будущем что-то произошло. Связь с большей частью населённых пунктов Земли оборвалась. Космонавты передали с орбиты, что видят сверху небольшое пятно в Восточной Европе, по своим очертаниям напоминающее круг. То, что военные находят за границей этого круга, шокирует. В магазинах, в автомобилях, на дорогах, в зданиях больниц и вокзалов, повсюду — следы столкновений. Кто или что уничтожает всё живое? И как долго продержится последний аванпост человечества?","tagline":"Кто спасет тебя, когда мир погрузится во тьму?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jlGqQsOOwD9qU1QOhAxyqFB2Ylz.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4phMeITqEnShF5C3ZD0Q8YQFMAB.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":574982,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ru-RU","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jlGqQsOOwD9qU1QOhAxyqFB2Ylz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jlGqQsOOwD9qU1QOhAxyqFB2Ylz.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jlGqQsOOwD9qU1QOhAxyqFB2Ylz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jlGqQsOOwD9qU1QOhAxyqFB2Ylz.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/avl9MEQhtvokNnzoWepkmHBZ2ss.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/avl9MEQhtvokNnzoWepkmHBZ2ss.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/avl9MEQhtvokNnzoWepkmHB